   "text": "demo  \u00b7  tn_demo\n\nwindow  12 before / 4 after\nfields   F80, Topsize, Hue, Sat,\n         Light                      (5)\ncategories  feed_material, equipment,\n         process_control, instrument (4)\n\ninstrument  simulated belt PSD analyzer\nsampling    regular, 1/min\ncap         $1.00 / call\n\nNo SDRatio, no RGB \u2014 so its agent\nphysically cannot cite them.",
   "originalText": "demo  \u00b7  tn_demo\n\nwindow  12 before / 4 after\nfields   F80, Topsize, Hue, Sat,\n         Light                      (5)\ncategories  feed_material, equipment,\n         process_control, instrument (4)\n\ninstrument  simulated belt PSD analyzer\nsampling    regular, 1/min\ncap         $1.00 / call\n\nNo SDRatio, no RGB \u2014 so its agent\nphysically cannot cite them.",
