   "text": "\u2461 executor adds what the\n   model may not supply\n\nq = select(Outlier).join(Channel)\n .where(Channel.tenant_id ==\n        principal.tenant_id)   \u2190 ADDED\n .where(Channel.id == arg.channel_id)\n .limit(min(arg.limit, 50))",
   "originalText": "\u2461 executor adds what the\n   model may not supply\n\nq = select(Outlier).join(Channel)\n .where(Channel.tenant_id ==\n        principal.tenant_id)   \u2190 ADDED\n .where(Channel.id == arg.channel_id)\n .limit(min(arg.limit, 50))",
