   "frameId": null,
   "text": "THE FIVE TOOLS \u2014 list_channels()  \u00b7  query_outliers(channel?, severity?, status?, since?, until?, limit\u226450)\nmeasurement_window(channel, around_t, before\u226440, after\u226420)  \u00b7  channel_stats(channel, metric, window)  \u00b7  get_diagnosis(outlier_id)\nCorrelation across channels is deliberately NOT here yet \u2014 one auditable layer at a time.",
   "originalText": "THE FIVE TOOLS \u2014 list_channels()  \u00b7  query_outliers(channel?, severity?, status?, since?, until?, limit\u226450)\nmeasurement_window(channel, around_t, before\u226440, after\u226420)  \u00b7  channel_stats(channel, metric, window)  \u00b7  get_diagnosis(outlier_id)\nCorrelation across channels is deliberately NOT here yet \u2014 one auditable layer at a time.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r50",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
