   "text": "routes/agent.py                                  EXISTS \u00b7 extend\n  GET  /api/agent/threads              (built)\n  GET  /api/agent/threads/{id}         (built)\n  POST /api/agent/threads/{id}/messages   NEW  \u2190 ask\n  POST /api/agent/ask                     NEW  \u2190 new thread\n\ntests/\n  test_agent_tools.py      NEW  executor, incl. cross-tenant args\n  test_agent_context.py    NEW  budget maths, elision markers\n  test_cross_tenant_leak.py     EXISTS \u00b7 extend with new routes",
   "originalText": "routes/agent.py                                  EXISTS \u00b7 extend\n  GET  /api/agent/threads              (built)\n  GET  /api/agent/threads/{id}         (built)\n  POST /api/agent/threads/{id}/messages   NEW  \u2190 ask\n  POST /api/agent/ask                     NEW  \u2190 new thread\n\ntests/\n  test_agent_tools.py      NEW  executor, incl. cross-tenant args\n  test_agent_context.py    NEW  budget maths, elision markers\n  test_cross_tenant_leak.py     EXISTS \u00b7 extend with new routes",
