   "text": "apps/web/\n  lib/api.ts               + askAgent(threadId, text)\n  lib/types.ts             + AgentAskResponse\n  components/screens/AgentScreen.tsx\n     composer becomes live; optimistic user turn;\n     assistant turn renders citations as links\n\nIMPORT DIRECTION (no cycles)\n  routes \u2192 agent_loop \u2192 {agent_context, agent_tools} \u2192 harness \u2192 models\n  agent_threads is a leaf: it records, it never calls a model.",
   "originalText": "apps/web/\n  lib/api.ts               + askAgent(threadId, text)\n  lib/types.ts             + AgentAskResponse\n  components/screens/AgentScreen.tsx\n     composer becomes live; optimistic user turn;\n     assistant turn renders citations as links\n\nIMPORT DIRECTION (no cycles)\n  routes \u2192 agent_loop \u2192 {agent_context, agent_tools} \u2192 harness \u2192 models\n  agent_threads is a leaf: it records, it never calls a model.",
